{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n各位 Chiikawa 粉絲準備好荷包！超人氣角色 Chiikawa 全新主題系列「Chiikawa Clinic」將於 11 月 27 日正式登場。屆時，香港 CHIIKAWA SHOP 的二樓空間亦會搖身一變成為醫院主題專區，與日本同步零時差發售！今次一眾角色將換上可愛的醫生與護士造型，勢必以滿滿的萌力療癒大家心靈。\n</p>\n<p>日本官方現已搶先公開全系列周邊商品及定價詳情，品項極度豐富，涵蓋收藏小物、實用生活雜貨以至秋冬服飾，讓粉絲一次過將心頭好帶回家：<br/>\n-人氣收藏精品（約 HK$32 – $115）：囊括粉絲最愛的醫護造型吊飾公仔、精緻徽章及桌面立牌。<br/>\n-外出必備袋款（約 HK$20 – $115）：推出多款實用收納包及人氣「痛包」，方便粉絲將心愛的 Chiikawa 掛飾公仔裝入袋中。<br/>\n-特色夜光貼紙（約 HK$20 起）：除了常規款式，今次更特別推出專為手機及牆壁設計的「夜光貼紙」，在暗處散發可愛微光，入手門檻極親民。</p>\n<p>-實用生活好物（約 HK$32 起）：備有不同尺寸的純棉毛巾、日常卡片套、文具及角色名牌等，為日常生活注入滿滿可愛儀式感。<br/>\n-秋冬主題服飾（約 HK$115 – $435）：同步推出長袖衛衣、短袖 T 恤、保暖外套及襪子等多款穿搭單品。</p>\n<p>Chiikawa Clinic 主題區 @ CHIIKAWA SHOP in HONG KONG 二樓店<br/>\n地址：MOKO 新世紀廣場 2 樓 236 舖<br/>\n營業日期 : 11月27日 – 1月12日<br/>\n營業時間 :<br/>\n預約進場期間 | 10:00 – 22:00<br/>\n自由進場期間 | 11:30 – 21:30</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992579451759_1371310046af5e2ba402f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992579451759_1371310046af5e2ba402f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992595401615_18012819026af5e2bbed5b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992595401615_18012819026af5e2bbed5b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926122115511_15778222486af5e2bdb0ede.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926122115511_15778222486af5e2bdb0ede.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926319277297_3648606016af5e2bf96077.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926319277297_3648606016af5e2bf96077.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992647835961_6076296166af5e2c1832e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944992647835961_6076296166af5e2c1832e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926715981074_7078614656af5e2c3889fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926715981074_7078614656af5e2c3889fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926878314748_10948746316af5e2c531bc4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449926878314748_10948746316af5e2c531bc4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449927046942543_4857693996af5e2c6e1711.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179449927046942543_4857693996af5e2c6e1711.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfpOIrIDLEt/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.687252+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":841,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:57:55.499951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:51.375025+00:00","content_hash":"54ced352156a707e0f53db809cf793269065fbc6f15871bbf2968509041ac1b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}